version numbering schema:
M.N.P
| | +-- patch: increased if only bug fixed were incorporated
| +---- minor: increased if syntax/semantic breaking changes were applied
+------ major: increased if elementary changes (from user's point of view) were made

3.1.0 (2026-11-11)
 - added: Paste Embedded Image (Ctrl+Shift+I, toolbar icon off by default) pastes the clipboard image as <img> with data: URI
 - added: double-clicking a link destination in the Markdown (NppToolBox) language opens the link
 - changed: parentheses, angle brackets and titles around link destinations no longer take the URL style
 - changed: About menu entry is named About... because it opens a window
 - fixed: code blocks in the Markdown (NppToolBox) language show the backgrounds of their theme styles
 - fixed: double click on a link destination in the Markdown (NppToolBox) language opens the destination, not the URL Notepad++ detects there, which can take in the characters after it

3.0.0 (2026-11-08)
 - added: Mermaid diagrams drawn in Render HTML, Copy as HTML and the Markdown Viewer
 - added: all diagram types of Mermaid 12.2.0, including the beta ones, with an own renderer
 - added: Mermaid themes, the looks classic, neo and handDrawn and the layouts elk and dagre
 - added: math, Font Awesome icons and architecture icons in Mermaid diagrams
 - added: Mermaid diagrams as PNG pictures in the RichEdit viewer and in Copy as HTML
 - added: settings section [Mermaid] (Enabled, MaxTextSize, MaxEdges)
 - added: more TeX commands in math: KaTeX's symbols, \def, \newcommand, \href, \colorbox, CD
 - added: equation numbers in math with \tag, \label, \ref and \eqref
 - added: Compact Markdown Table (Ctrl+Alt+P, toolbar icon off by default) removes cell padding
 - added: language Markdown (NppToolBox) colors Markdown in the editor, code blocks by their lexer
 - added: setting [Lexer] Markdown (0: off, 1: language, 2: used for all Markdown files)
 - added: Render HTML and Copy as HTML show code documents as a code block of their language
 - added: setting [Html] CodeAsCodeBlock (on by default)
 - changed: DLL is about 5 MiB larger (diagram renderer, themes and icons)
 - changed: build feature font-awesome (on by default) holds the icons of Mermaid diagrams

2.1.0 (2026-11-01)
 - added: Select Comments (Ctrl+Alt+N, toolbar icon off by default) selects all comments
 - added: RichEdit viewer shows all image formats with a Windows Imaging Component (WIC) codec
 - added: TIFF, JPEG XL, HEIF, JPEG XR and DDS images embedded like the other local images
 - changed: Render HTML toolbar icon off by default (setting [Toolbar] RenderHtml)
 - changed: images decoded and PNG encoded with WIC (DLL is about 500 KiB smaller)
 - changed: build feature pure-rust decodes images with Rust crates as before
 - fixed: activating Notepad++ no longer raises the detached viewer window above other windows
 - fixed: crash of EdgeHTML viewer by commands sent from another programs

2.0.0 (2026-10-18)
 - added: Markdown Viewer (Ctrl+Alt+M, toolbar) with a live preview of the active document
 - added: viewer docked as side panel or detached to a maximizable window (Detach/Dock button)
 - added: viewer option to follow the caret and mark the selected blocks (Follow caret)
 - added: viewer engines Microsoft Edge WebView2 (default if available) and RichEdit (fallback)
 - added: WebView2 used via WebView2Loader.dll next to NppToolBox.dll or the installed runtime
 - added: viewer engine EdgeHTML of the legacy Microsoft Edge (Engine=2)
 - added: links in the viewer opened in the browser, Notepad++ or the default application
 - added: target of the hovered link shown in a bar below the viewer
 - added: copy from the viewer with Ctrl+C and the context menu
 - added: viewer in GitHub's dark style in Notepad++'s dark mode
 - added: settings section [Viewer] (Engine, FollowCaret, Detached, UpdateDelay)
 - added: settings section [Toolbar] to show or hide each toolbar icon
 - changed: Rust 1.95 or newer required to build
 - changed: windows-core added as runtime dependency (COM interfaces of WebView2)
 - changed: toolbar icons rendered at runtime in the exact size of the toolbar and DPI
 - changed: resvg added as runtime dependency (SVG icon rendering)
 - fixed: alert icons missing in Copy as HTML (LibreOffice, Office) and in the RichEdit viewer
 - fixed: pictures in the RichEdit viewer drawn over the paragraph above and cut off at the bottom
 - fixed: Rewrap joining the alert marker line (> [!NOTE]) with the alert text
 - fixed: image embedding test using an invalid file: URI on Windows

1.0.0 (2026-10-16)
 - first release
